== Trivia ==
* Upon entering a room with only half a heart left, a small yellow spot, presumably urine, will appear underneath Isaac.
** If Isaac has {{i|Kidney Stone}}, a bloodstain will appear instead of urine.
** {{dlc|a+}}As {{c|Eve}} and {{c|Tainted Eve}}, a bloodstain will appear instead of urine.
* {{dlc|r}}Eternal Hearts have a special animation if used by a character who cannot use red hearts, where the animation of the hearts joining together will show their respective heart type.
* There is a half Coin Heart graphic left in the files. To see it, you must have half a Red Heart, use {{i|Clicker}}, and turn into {{c|Keeper}}.
* The most amount of hearts Isaac can have on one heart slot is a Bone, Gold, Eternal, Rotten heart.

